<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
      .header { background: #1a365d; color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0; }
      .content { background: #f9f9f9; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px; }
      .button { 
        background-color: #2E7D32; 
        color: white; 
        padding: 12px 24px; 
        text-decoration: none; 
        border-radius: 5px; 
        display: inline-block;
        margin: 20px 0;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
      .warning { color: #ff4444; font-size: 14px; background: #ffeaa7; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; }
      .info { background-color: #e7f3ff; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; border-left: 4px solid #2E7D32; }
      .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; color: #666; font-size: 14px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        {{{logoHtml}}}
        <h2 style="color: white;">Welcome to Grocery App!</h2>
      </div>
      
      <div class="content">
        <p>Thank you for registering. To complete your account setup, please verify your email and set your password.</p>
        
        <div class="info">
          <p><strong>Important:</strong> This verification link will expire in <strong>1 hour</strong>.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Click the button below to verify your email and set your password:</p>
        
        <p>Click the link below to verify your email:</p>
        <a href="{{CLIENT_URL}}/verify-email?token={{token}}&email={{email}}" 
            style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #9ec79fff; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;">
            Verify Email
        </a>
        
        <div class="warning">
          <strong>Note:</strong> If you don't verify within 1 hour, you'll need to request a new verification link.
        </div>
        
        <p>If you didn't create an account, please ignore this email.</p>
        
        <div class="footer">
          <p>Thank you,<br><strong>The Grocery App Team</strong></p>
          <p>Need help? Contact us at support@groceryapp.com</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>